Distribution requirements
-------------------------

When distributing binaries built from this repository, provide the
corresponding source and build/porting changes required by each component's
license. Preserve copyright notices, license texts, disclaimers, and required
attribution in the source tree and in the distributed artifacts. Do not
describe the entire distribution as Apache-2.0 unless the statement is
explicitly limited to reliefnt-owned code and all third-party terms remain
visible.
